00:20:51.979 --> 00:20:54.042
Charlie says, you know,

00:20:54.042 --> 00:20:55.962
you paid for me,

00:20:55.962 --> 00:20:58.080
you get,

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:02.460
you trust me with all
with all your information.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.406
Just the final thought, if I can.

00:21:04.406 --> 00:21:07.230
I was thinking when I've seen you,

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:10.430
you know when I've been
actually face to face with you,

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:11.290
with your creation

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.560
and there's only one that
really comes to mind,

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:14.740
which was your cameo

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:18.330
in the London 2012 Olympic
Games Opening Ceremony,

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:19.310
and for those who haven't seen it,

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:20.400
obviously millions did,

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:22.670
you were on stage in a,

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:25.180
in an amazing looking
sort of lit up house.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.950
And you look like you're typing

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:29.308
and then a message appeared
across the audience,

00:21:29.308 --> 00:21:31.037
beamed across the audience which said,

00:21:31.037 --> 00:21:32.790
"This is for everyone."

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:34.880
How did that feel doing that?

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:35.713
And you know,

00:21:35.713 --> 00:21:37.040
being on that showcase?

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:39.370
It was beeping amazing.

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:41.330
It was absolutely incredible.

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:42.560
Such a privilege to be,

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:46.490
I mean to be asked to sit in that stadium

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:50.960
with, I mean to be part of the crew

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:53.830
for the Opening Ceremony of the Olympics

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:56.314
was, you know all volunteers,

00:21:56.314 --> 00:21:58.520
a few total stars,

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:01.530
total stars that I'd really respected

00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:02.810
and you can meet backstage,

00:22:02.810 --> 00:22:05.956
and then when I was in that before the.

00:22:05.956 --> 00:22:08.940
There's was a house

00:22:08.940 --> 00:22:10.316
around you.
The house was around me.

00:22:10.316 --> 00:22:11.800
Lifted up didn't it?
And before it lifted up,

00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:12.770
I was sitting there

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:14.700
and I had to front myself against

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:15.540
the back wall of the house,

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:18.932
'cause all thousands of
dancers had been dancing,

00:22:18.932 --> 00:22:21.420
all wearing different costumes,

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:24.020
all they'd all been wearing,
dancing, different dances.

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:28.080
And they all left the entire
stadium came flocking in

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:30.052
and they all went in through
the door of the house,

00:22:30.052 --> 00:22:32.726
and some of them they
all knew where to go.

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:35.170
and they could go left or right,

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:36.100
and up and down,

00:22:36.100 --> 00:22:37.570
and they all had to disappear.

00:22:37.570 --> 00:22:38.606
And they,

00:22:38.606 --> 00:22:41.190
so they came running incredibly excited

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:42.060
and just had the dance

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:43.080
of their lives.
Yes.

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:46.350
And there, and they've
expressed their individuality.

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:47.840
And, but also their common you know,

00:22:47.840 --> 00:22:51.280
the commonality of working
together on the Olympic,

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:53.180
on the Olympic Ceremony and
the commonality of working

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:54.890
together for the Olympic Games

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:57.170
So that was just.
Amazing.

00:22:57.170 --> 00:22:58.400
Incredible, incredible.

00:22:58.400 --> 00:23:00.060
Well and such a powerful message.

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:01.640
You know, this is for everyone.

00:23:01.640 --> 00:23:03.113
What you created that must have given you

00:23:03.113 --> 00:23:05.053
an amazing feeling.

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:07.293
Tim Berners-Lee,

00:23:07.293 --> 00:23:08.126
Sir Tim Berners-Lee,

00:23:08.126 --> 00:23:09.631
thank you so much for talking to me.

00:23:09.631 --> 00:23:11.220
The pleasure's mine.

00:23:11.220 --> 00:23:13.320
And thank you so much for being with us

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:14.489
until we meet again,

00:23:14.489 --> 00:23:16.070
stay safe.

00:23:16.070 --> 00:23:16.903
Goodbye.

